          "reason": "Accept the ordinary Enter make code as well as keypad Enter. The original handler rejected every one-byte key, making the displayed Enter launch instruction ineffective."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/src/Game/menu.c",
          "originalSha256": "bedf35fcc7415c7fdb3b89ea4dc9c5dea1acc0c8cce41f71e99445e122f51cd7",
